{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-192",
  "title": "Market Analysis (High level)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Market Analysis (High level)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Fundamental Human Drivers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The form-builder market addresses several core human needs:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Control and efficiency** - People want to collect information in an organized way without building systems from scratch. Forms represent structured communication and data collection that brings order to chaos."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Recognition and connection** - Forms facilitate feedback, registration, and information exchange - all ways humans seek to be heard and to connect with others."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Emotional states people seek:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Moving away from: Confusion, information overload, and the anxiety of missing important data"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Moving toward: Clarity, efficiency, and the satisfaction of orderly information collection"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Unspoken drivers:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fear of appearing unprofessional with poorly designed forms"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Anxiety about technological limitations (can I build what I need?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Status concerns about using modern, design-forward tools like Typeform versus \"old-school\" solutions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. User/Customer Understanding"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Non-obvious users:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "IT departments who must approve form tools for security compliance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Data analysts who need to work with form responses"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Form respondents themselves, who often have little voice in the design process"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Current compromises:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Accepting limited customization options"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Managing data across disconnected systems"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dealing with mobile-unfriendly form experiences"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Belief vs. behavior disconnects:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Users say they want comprehensive feature sets but often use only basic functionality"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Organizations claim to prioritize respondent experience but choose tools based on back-end integration capabilities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Users state price sensitivity but pay premiums for tools that save time"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Trigger moments:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Event planning and registration needs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "New compliance requirements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Organizational growth requiring more structured data collection"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Frustration with existing processes (email replies, spreadsheets)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Market Gaps and Inefficiencies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Surprisingly hard:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Creating truly conditional logic that handles complex scenarios"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Designing forms that work equally well across all devices"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Building forms that feel conversational rather than bureaucratic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Integration with existing data systems without technical expertise"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Abundance without clarity:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Overwhelming template libraries with no clear guidance on best practices"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Feature bloat in many tools with unclear use cases"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pricing models that are difficult to compare across platforms"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Neglected touchpoints:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Post-submission experience for respondents"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Data governance and compliance aspects"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Form analytics beyond basic completion rates"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Language and Narrative"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Natural customer language:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"I need to collect some info\" (not \"I need to deploy a data collection interface\")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"I want to make a survey\" (even when not conducting research)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Quick form\" (emphasizing speed and simplicity)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Problem framing disconnect:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Users: \"I just need something simple that works\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Industry: \"Enterprise-grade form solution with robust workflow capabilities\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Reinforced assumptions:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "That form-building requires technical knowledge"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "That better design necessarily means more complexity"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "That forms are inherently transactional rather than relationship-building"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Competitive & Strategic Insight"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Innovation disincentives:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Established players like JotForm and Google Forms maintain broad feature sets that limit radical redesigns"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Enterprise focus creates resistance to simplification"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Edge innovations:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Conversational UI (Typeform pioneered, others following)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No-code integration capabilities (Tally.so, Notion)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design-forward approaches (Typeform, Tally)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-78",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AI-assisted form creation and response analysis (emerging)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Radical simplification potential:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Forms that create themselves from natural language prompts"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-82",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Truly conversational interfaces that adapt to user responses"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-83",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Forms that learn from past submissions to become more efficient"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Business model alternatives:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-86",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Usage-based pricing vs. current feature-tier models"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Respondent-focused models (better experiences = higher completion)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Data insights as the primary value proposition rather than collection"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Temporal and Cultural Dimensions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Long-term shifts:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-92",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Growing privacy consciousness changing data collection norms"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-93",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Rising expectations for mobile-first experiences"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-94",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Increasing desire for personalization"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-95",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AI integration becoming standard for form analysis and creation"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Overlooked traditions:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-98",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Human conversation as the original \"form\" (being reclaimed by conversational interfaces)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-99",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The ritual aspects of information sharing (forms as ceremonies)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-100",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cultural differences in information disclosure comfort"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**10-year outlook:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-108",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-103",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AI will likely eliminate traditional form building entirely for many use cases"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-104",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Forms will become dynamic conversations rather than static documents"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-105",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The distinction between forms, surveys, and data collection interfaces will blur"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-106",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Value will shift from collection to insight generation and action"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-107",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Privacy and consent mechanisms will become more sophisticated and central to the experience"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The most successful future players will likely win on intelligence (helping users know what to ask) rather than just interface design or feature sets."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}